  <!-- EN: raw honey -->
  <VFEM2_Honey.label>蜂蜜</VFEM2_Honey.label>
  <!-- EN: Raw, unprocessed honey harvested from an apiary, very sugary and fun to eat while also extremely long-lasting, perfect for taking on caravan trips, fermenting into mead, or baking into desserts. -->
  <VFEM2_Honey.description>从蜂巢中被取出，未被加工过的蜂蜜，非常甜美，保质期也很长，适合带在远行队中，发酵成蜜酒或是做成甜品。</VFEM2_Honey.description>
  
